          "text": " Kwaŋin kodau Solomon etogo loka EJAKAIT, ka etogo loka ekabaka: kokeriana Solomon aiswamaun kere nualomakinete otauke aiswamakin togo loka EJAKAIT, ka togoke da, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.7.11"
            ]
